---
import Layout from '../../../layouts/Layout.astro';
import Header from '../../../components/Header.astro';
import Footer from '../../../components/Footer.astro';
---

<Layout title="Field Expedition - August | Ñaupa Iglesia | Primigenias 33 Institute" description="The Temple of Primal Antiquity">
  <Header />

  <main class="page-main">
    <section class="page-header hero-bg-overlay" style="background-image: linear-gradient(to bottom, rgba(10,10,14,0.7), var(--bg-dark)), url('/images/naupa-iglesia.png');">
      <div class="container text-center scroll-reveal">
        <a href="/en/eventos-presenciales/" class="back-link">← Back to Annual Program</a>
        <h1 class="page-title text-gradient-flame" style="margin-top: 1rem;">Field Expedition - August | Ñaupa Iglesia</h1>
        <p class="lead">The Temple of Primal Antiquity</p>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="section">
      <div class="container text-content-box glass-panel breathing-glow">
        
        <div class="detail-block">
          <h3 style="color: var(--accent-cyan);">Climate & Season</h3>
          <p>Mid dry winter in Cusco. This is the sacred month of Pachamama (Mother Earth), the celestial juncture when the earth opens in receptivity, marking the peak of spiritual introspection.</p>
        </div>

        <div class="detail-block">
          <h3 style="color: var(--accent-gold);">Brief Mystical History</h3>
          <p>Also known as Choquequilla ("Golden Temple"), it is an enigmatic pre-Hispanic sanctuary cave. It houses a flawless trapezoidal portal hewn directly into dark living rock—leading to no physical chamber. It features a finely polished monolithic altar carved with a stepped Chakana (Andean Cross) harmonized with the Southern Cross and the Milky Way. Ñaupa Iglesia is an underworld sanctuary (Uku Pacha) and dimensional vortex. Unlike temples dedicated to the solar realm (Hanan Pacha), this subterranean huaca accesses origin, dissolution, and rebirth. Its three-dimensional "blind niche", carved with breathtaking geometric perfection, serves as an interdimensional gateway to the realm of ancestral consciousness.</p>
        </div>

        <div class="detail-block">
          <h3 style="color: var(--accent-orange);">Subjects of Work</h3>
          <p>Ñaupa translates as "ancient" or "primal". Within this cavern, we decode Numerical Engrams and the Ancestral Tree (unconscious imprints). The mathematical acoustics of the cave absorb external frequency, inducing absolute silence. Here, the student reprograms the root "biological impact" that conditions automatic survival reflexes.</p>
        </div>

        <div class="text-center" style="margin-top: 4rem;">
          <a href="https://wa.me/51967747483" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="btn btn-primary btn-lg">
            Inquire Dates on WhatsApp
          </a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>
  </main>

  <Footer />
</Layout>

<style>
  .page-main { padding-bottom: 4rem; }
  .page-header { padding: 5rem 1rem; text-align: center; background-position: center; background-size: cover; }
  .page-title { font-size: 2.5rem; font-weight: 800; margin: 1rem 0; }
  .back-link { color: var(--accent-cyan); text-decoration: none; font-weight: bold; }
  .back-link:hover { text-decoration: underline; }
  .text-content-box { max-width: 800px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 3rem; border-radius: 16px; margin-top: -3rem; position: relative; z-index: 10; text-align: left; }
  .detail-block { margin-bottom: 2.5rem; }
  .detail-block h3 { font-size: 1.5rem; margin-bottom: 1rem; }
  .detail-block p { font-size: 1.15rem; color: var(--text-muted); line-height: 1.8; }
</style>
